BRUME / Studio letters 02
Material letter / Ribbed glass

One edge. Many lines.

A window makes one long reflection in the shade. Follow it down to the foot a=
nd it breaks into a row of short, bright lines.

The shade
Its smooth curve carries a reflection in one sweep.

The foot
Each vertical rib catches the light at a slightly different angle.

Look closer at the materials
https://jocelyn-martinez-ui.github.io/brume/collection.html#materials

BRUME is a fictional lighting studio. This unsent letter and its AI-generated=
 imagery are part of Jocelyn Martinez=E2=80=99s design portfolio.
Design case study
https://jocelyn-martinez-ui.github.io/brume/index.html#email

